cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "torchwavelets: differentiable discrete wavelet transforms for PyTorch"
abstract: >-
  torchwavelets is a torch-native successor to the unmaintained
  pytorch_wavelets package. It provides 1D/2D discrete wavelet transforms,
  1D/2D/3D dual-tree complex wavelet transforms with native complex tensors,
  DTCWT scattering networks (including a general arbitrary-order network),
  the stationary (undecimated) wavelet transform and wavelet packets — all
  bit-exact against PyWavelets and the reference numpy dtcwt package, with a
  full dtype/device/autocast precision contract, torch.compile support, a
  pytorch_wavelets compatibility layer, and GPU validation on NVIDIA
  Grace-Hopper and AMD MI210.
authors:
  - family-names: El Montassir
    given-names: Rachid
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - wavelet
  - dwt
  - dtcwt
  - dual-tree complex wavelet transform
  - scattering transform
  - stationary wavelet transform
  - wavelet packets
  - pytorch
  - deep learning
  - signal processing
repository-code: "https://github.com/relmonta/torchwavelets"
